cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SMB-optimizer: operating-condition optimizer for simulated moving bed chromatography"
message: If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yadong (Leo)
    family-names: Chiang
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/YC-Leo/SMB-optimizer
url: https://github.com/YC-Leo/SMB-optimizer
abstract: >-
  An open-source optimizer that finds the flow rates and switch time of a simulated moving bed (SMB)
  chromatography unit that maximize feed throughput or minimize desorbent use while the extract and
  raffinate meet purity and recovery targets. Every candidate operating point is simulated to cyclic
  steady state with a full SMB model (competitive Langmuir isotherm, linear-driving-force mass
  transfer, axial dispersion, optional volume change), and a trust-region SQP method searches the
  operating space. Written in Python with NumPy and SciPy.
keywords:
  - simulated moving bed
  - chromatography
  - process optimization
  - separation
  - chemical engineering
  - adsorption
